      "id": "claim_004dc74154ab4ec5a76779fd891dbf84",
      "statement": "The Vulkan compute builder constructs a Maxwell control-flow graph from an environment and start address, then passes it to TranslateProgram. The shared recompiler constructs a structured syntax list and block order and records stage-specific metadata in IR::Program. For compute, it gets workgroup size and shared memory size from the environment. Compare guest decode with IR before investigating a backend opcode.",
