      "id": "claim_da8ff086ea8b455b98a4cd3c249028be",
      "statement": "For graphics stages, PipelineCache supplies EmitSPIRV with a stage profile, runtime info and resource bindings, then builds a Vulkan shader module. The compute path validates the constant buffer mask and can clamp shared memory on selected drivers before emission. Host capability policy can therefore affect lowering or emission for the same guest shader.",
