    {
      "id": "claim_56e290478a224e95af632dbece4116aa",
      "statement": "LoadDiskResources is title-scoped and ignores title ID zero. Before changing cache files it waits for outstanding serialization work. It uses separate paths for serialized pipeline data and used-pipeline tracking, with a distinct suffix for the title workaround that changes lowered code. Review cache compatibility when changing the representation of persisted environments.",
