    {
      "id": "claim_80296b8db12b4fb7951e5f348117bd75",
      "statement": "The repository includes Maxwell disassembly, IR and SPIR-V tools as separate entry points. Use a disassembly to inspect guest decode, an IR dump to inspect translation, and SPIR-V to inspect backend output. For stable regression output, the expect-test helper compares emitted text against a reference.",
